(6781853, 1017426, 138253, '<td valign="top">While the tree is still OoF, i feel that the angle of this does not do justice to the shot as the tree still feels like an overly large/imposing figure here - it almost ''feels'' like you were trying to get a shot of the tree and your camera locked onto the plant instead. (my opinion)</td>', 'While the tree is still OoF, i feel that the angle of this does not do justice to the shot as the tree still feels like an overly large/imposing figure here - it almost ''feels'' like you were trying to get a shot of the tree and your camera locked onto the plant instead. (my opinion)', '2012-05-30 16:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6781855, 1018058, 138253, '<td valign="top">Definitely a different thought for macro subject matter</td>', 'Definitely a different thought for macro subject matter', '2012-05-30 16:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6781856, 1017939, 138253, '<td valign="top">i know it''s nitpicking, but the stem of the close plant and the ''bulb'' of the second are both in focus and it''s bugging me that it isn''t one entire unit in focus compared to obscured foreground/background. That could be what you''re going for, but it just doesn''t look right to me.<br/>I''m sure it has more to do with them tilting towards the camera or something along those lines, but still...i find it distracting.</td>', 'i know it''s nitpicking, but the stem of the close plant and the ''bulb'' of the second are both in focus and it''s bugging me that it isn''t one entire unit in focus compared to obscured foreground/background. That could be what you''re going for, but it just doesn''t look right to me.I''m sure it has more to do with them tilting towards the camera or something along those lines, but still...i find it distracting.', '2012-05-30 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6781858, 1017979, 138253, '<td valign="top">he looks hillarious.</td>', 'he looks hillarious.', '2012-05-30 16:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
