(6785538, 1017393, 114106, '<td valign="top">Nice capture though I would have liked to see some localized lighening on the body of the Dragonfly. Fast shot, very sharp detail on wings.</td>', 'Nice capture though I would have liked to see some localized lighening on the body of the Dragonfly. Fast shot, very sharp detail on wings.', '2012-06-04 10:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785540, 1018176, 114106, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, focusing and color blend, would love to know camera and lens and what were the settings.</td>', 'Nice composition, focusing and color blend, would love to know camera and lens and what were the settings.', '2012-06-04 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785543, 1017854, 114106, '<td valign="top">This image gave me pause. I questioned the photographers message and felt at first, a quick shot to satisfy a contest but then, as I looked at the image longer, I felt a sense of relaxation, of not being challenged but being relaxed. <br/> <br/>Interesting response to a compositionly correct image.</td>', 'This image gave me pause. I questioned the photographers message and felt at first, a quick shot to satisfy a contest but then, as I looked at the image longer, I felt a sense of relaxation, of not being challenged but being relaxed.  Interesting response to a compositionly correct image.', '2012-06-04 10:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785545, 1017134, 114106, '<td valign="top">An unexpected submission. Nice response to the challenge!</td>', 'An unexpected submission. Nice response to the challenge!', '2012-06-04 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785546, 1018066, 114106, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot, would have scored even higher with me if a little more work on the lighting!</td>', 'A really nice shot, would have scored even higher with me if a little more work on the lighting!', '2012-06-04 10:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785550, 1017812, 114106, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused Macro, a difficult shot with good balance of FOV and soft background. Well done indeed!</td>', 'Nicely focused Macro, a difficult shot with good balance of FOV and soft background. Well done indeed!', '2012-06-04 10:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
