(6785990, 1018066, 138630, '<td valign="top">Decided to try to comment on my middle of the road votes this time.  The detail and texture are good, the background is not distracting.  The colors are not appealing to me.</td>', 'Decided to try to comment on my middle of the road votes this time.  The detail and texture are good, the background is not distracting.  The colors are not appealing to me.', '2012-06-04 19:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
