(6785993, 1017901, 138630, '<td valign="top">Decided to try to comment on my middle of the road votes this time.  I find the moment you captured interesting but regret the lost antennae tips and wish the focus was sharper throughout.</td>', 'Decided to try to comment on my middle of the road votes this time.  I find the moment you captured interesting but regret the lost antennae tips and wish the focus was sharper throughout.', '2012-06-04 19:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
