(6799344, 1017755, 119169, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments :)<br/> <br/>My girlfriend took this awesome shot and i couldn''t resist uploading it!<br/> <br/>As the description says: I am an "extreme amateur". I unfortunately don''t have a camera with adaptable lenses nor does it have a true macro feature and i can only zoom in so far before it is unable to focus on an object.<br/> <br/>As for editing i am no wizz at this either and as much as i would''ve loved to zoom in to just show the dragon fly i wasn''t really sure how and as a newbie (only having entered once before) i wasn''t sure how much editing i could really do to fit into the rules :D!<br/> <br/>Thank you again for your helpful comments and i will try and improve for my next entry :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-21 14:48:10.</i></td>', 'Thank you for all your comments :) My girlfriend took this awesome shot and i couldn''t resist uploading it! As the description says: I am an "extreme amateur". I unfortunately don''t have a camera with adaptable lenses nor does it have a true macro feature and i can only zoom in so far before it is unable to focus on an object. As for editing i am no wizz at this either and as much as i would''ve loved to zoom in to just show the dragon fly i wasn''t really sure how and as a newbie (only having entered once before) i wasn''t sure how much editing i could really do to fit into the rules :D! Thank you again for your helpful comments and i will try and improve for my next entry :)', '2012-06-21 15:30:41.000000', '2012-06-21 15:48:10.000000', 0),
